@startuml US_3_2_5_Roles
title US 3.2.5 - Atribuir/atualizar roles internos

actor Admin
participant SPA as "Admin UI (Settings/Users)"
participant API as "AdminController"
participant ActSvc as "ActivationLinkService"
database DB as "PortContext\n(AppUsers, Roles, UserRoles, ActivationTokens)"

Admin -> SPA: selecionar utilizador
SPA -> API: PUT /admin/users/{id}/role {roleId}\nOU PUT /admin/users/{id}/roles {roleIds}
API -> DB: valida user + roles
alt troca roles ok
  DB --> API: updated
  API -> ActSvc: se user inativo e ganhou role\nCreateAndSendAsync(user)
  ActSvc -> DB: guardar ActivationToken
  ActSvc --> Admin: link + expiry
  API --> SPA: 204 No Content
else erro (sem admin suficiente, role inexistente)
  API --> SPA: 400/403/409 com mensagem
end

Admin -> SPA: POST /admin/users/{id}/role-change-links (opcional)
SPA -> Admin: confirma envio de email de role change

@enduml
